   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 10,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "CorridorKey 2.0\n\nFirst run downloads the models (~5 GB) to ComfyUI/models/corridorkey2 - it can take a few minutes; watch the console.\n\nOutputs:\n- QC: subject over a checkerboard, to judge the key\n- cutout: RGBA (despilled colour + alpha). Save Image writes transparent PNGs\n- matte: alpha\n\nHint (optional): connect a MASK.\n- 1 mask = first-frame hint\n- one per frame = full hint (SAM / BiRefNet / roto)\nhint_quality: 0.95 clean matte, 0.75 rough auto mask, 0.5 loose/dilated mask. Too high with a puffy mask = soft halo.\n\nThe whole batch is keyed as one clip; only connected outputs use RAM. For long 4K plates use 'CorridorKey 2.0 (Render to Disk)'."
   ]
  }
 ],
